# Extracted reference material.
#
# `assets/` is the scraped original site — its stylesheet, fonts and source
# media — kept locally so the port can be checked against it line by line. It is
# roughly 130 MB, none of it is imported by the app, and nothing in `src/` or
# `public/` depends on it. Everything the site actually serves lives in
# `public/assets/`, which is committed.
/assets/

.vercel
